  "body": "Where else can you find a boutique collection of stylish, quality three bedroom residences with northerly water views in great school zones?  \r\nRight here at 5-7 Calder Place, Glendowie\r\n\r\nEight thoughtfully designed two level, three-bedroom homes with extras everywhere. Garage with internal access, some homes having the option for additional parking, private courtyards, BOSCH appliances, built in fridge/ freezer, built in wardrobe systems, 2.7m studs and multiple bathrooms tiled floor to ceiling with the latest in fixtures and fittings plus a Stamford 10 year guarantee.\r\n\r\nThese are a perfect solution for downsizers wanting to stay in the area, families wanting affordable entry level to the best school zones or investors wanting a quality product.\r\n\r\nThey are just completed, so get in touch to book your viewing – These won’t last long !",
